|skill        = W
|icon         = Bellows Breath.png
|blurb        = {{sbc|Active:}} {{ci|Ornn}} marches in the target direction with {{tip|displacement immunity}}, belching fire in a cone that continually deals {{as|magic damage}} for a brief time. The final gout of flame will apply {{tip|Brittle}} for a short time.
|blurb4      = {{sbc|{{tip|displacement immunity|nolink=true}}:}} The march cannot be deterred by {{tip|crowd control}}. <br/><br/>
{{sbc|{{tip|Brittle|nolink=true}}:}} The target loses {{sti|tenacity}}, increasing the duration of incoming {{tip|crowd control}}.
|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Ornn''' {{tip|lunge|marches}} forward in the target direction over {{fd|0.75}} seconds, gaining {{tip|displacement immunity}} and becoming {{tip|lockout|unable to act}} for the duration.
|description2 = Over the march he belches fire over a cone in front of him, dealing {{as|magic damage}} every {{fd|0.15}} seconds to enemies hit. The final gout of flame can reach slightly farther and will apply {{tip|Brittle}} for 3 seconds.
|description3 = ''Bellows Breath'' has a minimum damage threshold, which is also the damage dealt to {{tip|minion|minions}}, and is capped against {{tip|monsters}}.
